      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790072408968,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- sending the whole file on each update takes lot of bandwidth\n- Optimized Approches\n    - Delta Sync: When a file is modifies only modified blocks are sync insted of the whole \n                     file using SYNC Alogirthms\n    - Compression: Compression Algorithms on blocks can significantly reduce the data size",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- sending the whole file on each update takes lot of bandwidth\n- Optimized Approches\n    - Delta Sync: When a file is modifies only modified blocks are sync insted of the whole \n                     file using SYNC Alogirthms\n    - Compression: Compression Algorithms on blocks can significantly reduce the data size",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
